{
    "title": "Leeloo AAC - Autism Speech App",
    "description": "Leeloo is an app that helps non-verbal kids to communicate with their parents, teachers and friends. Leeloo is developed with the AAC (Augmentative and Alternative Communication) and PECS (Picture Exchange Communication System) principles. Which is strong techniques for autism treatment and autism therapy in communication.\r\n\r\nIn this app, there is a card for every word that your kid might need to use in daily. And every card is matched with an definitive vector image about the phrase or word your kid trying to communicate.\r\n\r\nLeeloo also has voice capability. Every card pressed will reveal options of phrases, and the chosen phrase will be read by a text-to-speech robot. You can choose from over 10 voices you like in AAC Speech app Leeloo.\r\n\r\nLeeloo designed for kids suffering mental, learning or behavior disorders mostly Autism and is suitable for but not limited to; \r\n- Asperger's syndrome\r\n- Angelman syndrome\r\n- Down syndrome\r\n- Aphasia\r\n- Speech apraxia\r\n- ALS\r\n- MDN\r\n- Cerebral pally\r\n\r\nLeeloo has pre-configured and tested cards for preschool and currently attending school kids. But can be customized for an adult or a later age person who is suffering similar disorders or in the spectrum mentioned.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to your feedback, PLEASE take your time to add your comment with your app review.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Leeloo is an app that helps non-verbal kids to communicate with their parents, teachers and friends. Leeloo is developed with the AAC (Augmentative and Alternative Communication) and PECS (Picture Exchange Communication System) principles. Which is strong techniques for autism treatment and autism therapy in communication.<br><br>In this app, there is a card for every word that your kid might need to use in daily. And every card is matched with an definitive vector image about the phrase or word your kid trying to communicate.<br><br>Leeloo also has voice capability. Every card pressed will reveal options of phrases, and the chosen phrase will be read by a text-to-speech robot. You can choose from over 10 voices you like in AAC Speech app Leeloo.<br><br>Leeloo designed for kids suffering mental, learning or behavior disorders mostly Autism and is suitable for but not limited to; <br>- Asperger&#39;s syndrome<br>- Angelman syndrome<br>- Down syndrome<br>- Aphasia<br>- Speech apraxia<br>- ALS<br>- MDN<br>- Cerebral pally<br><br>Leeloo has pre-configured and tested cards for preschool and currently attending school kids. But can be customized for an adult or a later age person who is suffering similar disorders or in the spectrum mentioned.<br><br>We look forward to your feedback, PLEASE take your time to add your comment with your app review.",
